<title>HONG KONG: Jinhui interim net down 26.8 percent.</title>
<headline>Jinhui interim net down 26.8 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	 6.29	 vs 8.60</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)  4.0	  vs 2.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	44.44 gain vs 9.85 gain</p>
<p>    Net			  33.77	vs 46.14</p>
<p>    Turnover		   1,245.22   vs 1,188.56</p>
<p>    Company name	     Jinhui Holdings Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		September 24-27</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	 October 1</p>
<p>NOTE - A provider of shipping agency, feeder, lighterage and warehousing services.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on repurchase of convertible bonds, disposal of fixed assets, subsidiary companies and associated companies and currency translation.</p>
<p>Results for six months ended June 30, 1995, are restated to comply with Hong Kong Statement of Standard Accounting Practice 17. -- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
